We intend to operate air taxi services both directly and through strategic partnerships, while also pursuing aircraft sales to distributors and expanding into defense and other specialized markets. Our mission is to help the world connect faster and more easily with the people and places that matter most by delivering a new form of clean, fast, quiet and convenient aerial transportation service. The Joby eVTOL is being designed to transport a pilot and up to four passengers - or a targeted payload of up to 1,000 pounds - at speeds of up to 200 mph. The aircraft is optimized for urban routes, with a target range of up to 100 miles on a single charge. According to our modeling, more than 99% of urban routes i","zh":"我們花了十多年的時間設計和測試一款有人駕駛、全電動、垂直起降（“eVTOL”）空中計程車，我們打算在世界各地的城市運營該出租車。我們打算直接或透過戰略合作夥伴經營空中計程車服務，同時也向經銷商銷售飛機並擴展到國防和其他專業市場。我們的使命是透過提供新型清潔、快速、安靜和便利的航空運輸服務，幫助世界更快、更輕鬆地與最重要的人和地方建立聯繫。 Joby eVTOL 設計用於以高達 200 英里/小時的速度運送一名飛行員和最多四名乘客，或目標有效載荷高達 1,000 磅。該飛機針對城市航線進行了優化，一次充電的目標航程可達 100 英里。根據我們的建模，超過 99% 的城市路線都是由"},{"en":"Our aircraft has been specifically designed with multiple redundancies across systems and components for enhanced safety and to achieve a considerably lower noise footprint than that of similarly sized conventional aircraft or helicopters. It is quiet at takeoff and near silent when flying overhead, which we anticipate will allow us to operate from new vertiport locations nearer to where people live and work, in addition to utilizing the more than 5,000 heliport and airport infrastructure facilities already in existence in the U.S.","zh":"我們的飛機經過專門設計，跨系統和組件具有多重冗餘，以提高安全性，並實現比類似尺寸的傳統飛機或直升機低得多的噪音足跡。它起飛時非常安靜，飛過頭頂時幾乎無聲，我們預計這將使我們能夠在更靠近人們生活和工作地點的新垂直起降場地點運營，此外還可以利用美國現有的 5,000 多個直升機場和機場基礎設施​​。"},{"en":"We are in the process of certifying our aircraft with the U.S. Federal Aviation Administration (\"FAA\"). This involves a rigorous process of design, testing, verification and quality control. We have also begun working with regulators in other countries, including the United Kingdom, Japan, South Korea, Australia, the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, and the United Arab Emirates (\"UAE\") to pursue commercialization opportunities in those markets. While foreign certification in many","zh":"我們正在向美國聯邦航空管理局（“FAA”）認證我們的飛機。這涉及嚴格的設計、測試、驗證和品質控制過程。我們也開始與其他國家的監管機構合作，包括英國、日本、韓國、澳洲、沙烏地阿拉伯王國和阿拉伯聯合大公國（「阿聯酋」），以尋求這些市場的商業化機會。雖然國外認證很多"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We believe that the primary sources of competition for our service are ground-based mobility solutions, other eVTOL developers/operators and local/regional incumbent aircraft charter services.","zh":"我們認為，我們服務的主要競爭來源是地面移動解決方案、其他電動垂直起降開發商/營運商以及當地/區域現有的包機服務。"},{"en":"While there are differentiated approaches to vehicle designs and business models, we believe that our aircraft and vertically-integrated approach offer the greatest long-term prospects to certify and produce the best aircraft to serve our customers and, in turn, to monetize the full value chain from development through operations.","zh":"雖然車輛設計和商業模式有不同的方法，但我們相信，我們的飛機和垂直整合方法提供了最大的長期前景，可以認證和生產最好的飛機來服務我們的客戶，進而實現從開發到運營的整個價值鏈的貨幣化。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Passenger","val":34822000,"zh":"乘客"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":18603000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":53425000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":35751000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"JP","val":8134000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"Europe","val":6768000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2772000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":53425000}},"peers":["ACHR","RKLB","IONQ","RGTI","SOUN"]}}